<title>USA: Elcor sees higher fiscal Q4, year earnings.</title>
<headline>Elcor sees higher fiscal Q4, year earnings.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elcor Corp said its fiscal fourth quarter earnings will be well above the year-earlier $0.25 per share because of strong demand for the company's roofing and industrial products.</p>
<p>The company said its fiscal 1997 full-year earnings would be $1.30 and $1.50 per share, up from $1.16 for fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>The projections were contained in the company's third quarter earnings statement.</p>
</text>
